---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "Project::new().run(&[\"config\"])"
---
# claudegrep config

- `model` = `lightonai/LateOn-Code-edge` (default) — embedding model: a Hugging Face repo with an ONNX ColBERT export, or a local directory; changing it re-embeds everything
- `limit` = `8` (default) — number of search results
- `context` = `2` (default) — turns shown before and after `read --turn`
- `budget` = `24000` (default) — page size of `read` in characters, 0 for no limit
- `threads` = `1` — CPU threads for parsing and embedding; claudegrep also runs at the lowest scheduling priority
- `device` = `cpu` — where documents are embedded: `gpu`, `cpu`, or `auto`, which uses a GPU when the machine has one and stores `gpu` once that worked
- `projects-root` = `[ROOT]/projects` — Claude Code's projects directory
